// Config.example.xcconfig
// hetpaste — local build configuration template
//
// 1. Copy this file to `Config.xcconfig` (which is gitignored).
// 2. Keep personal build-only values here.
// 3. In Xcode: Project > Info > Configurations, set BOTH Debug and Release
//    "Based on Configuration File" to `Config` for the hetpaste target.
//
// Do not put AI API keys in this file. Released apps read user-provided keys
// from macOS Keychain via Settings instead of embedding secrets in the bundle.
